{"name":"Bite the Bullet","hex":"#ecebce","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bite the bullet","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To accept a negative aspect of a situation in order to proceed.","To accept an undesirable or counterintuitive implication of an argument or view."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bite_the_bullet"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bite the Bullet (EP)","blocks":[{"text":"Bite the Bullet is the fourth EP by American heavy metal band Black Tide. It was scheduled to be released in the fall of 2013 under the label InnerCat Music Group. The EP was produced and engineered by Mariano Aponte. This is the first release without drummer Steven Spence. The first single titled \"Not Afraid\", was released on August 31."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/6d/Album_Cover_for_Black_Tide%27s_EP_%22Bite_The_Bullet%22.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bite_the_Bullet_(EP)"},{"title":"Bite the Bullet (Hoodoo Gurus album)","blocks":[{"text":"Bite the Bullet is a compilation album by Australian rock group Hoodoo Gurus, released in July 1998."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/63/Bite_the_bulletLive.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bite_the_Bullet_(Hoodoo_Gurus_album)"},{"title":"Bite the Bullet (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Bite the Bullet is a 1975 American Western film written, produced, and directed by Richard Brooks and starring Gene Hackman, Candice Bergen, and James Coburn, with Ian Bannen, Jan-Michael Vincent, Ben Johnson and Dabney Coleman in supporting roles."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/03/Bite_the_bullet_movie_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bite_the_Bullet_(film)"},{"title":"Biting the bullet","blocks":[{"text":"\"Chew a bullet\" is a metaphor which is used to describe a situation, often a debate, where one accepts an inevitable impending hardship or hard-to-refute point, and then endures the resulting pain with fortitude."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Biting_the_bullet"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d6/Bite_the_bullet.jpg/250px-Bite_the_bullet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d6/Bite_the_bullet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d6/Bite_the_bullet.jpg/250px-Bite_the_bullet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bite the Bullet cover","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABite_the_bullet.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/ed/BiteBulletDoppelganger01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/ed/BiteBulletDoppelganger01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Doppelgänger cover","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABiteBulletDoppelganger01.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/00/BiteBulletBubbleSqueak01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/00/BiteBulletBubbleSqueak01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Bubble & Squeak cover","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABiteBulletBubbleSqueak01.jpg"}],"sounds":{"bite the bullet":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/25/En-au-bite_the_bullet.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_c